   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Priya. Your identity is verified.\n\nI found order O-5103 from Green Bowl, delivered tonight at 6:31 PM. The tofu wrap is listed as one item at $11.25. For a missing item, you can choose one of two options:\n\n1. **Refund of $11.25** to your Visa ending in 4242, or\n2. **Account credit of $13.50** (the item price plus 20%) for future Forkful orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
