   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, Priya. Okay, so the wrap is $11.25. Before I pick, I should mention the two lemonades were missing too, since I ordered two of them. Is there any way to get those covered as well?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, I can cover the lemonades too. Here are the options for each item:\n\n- **Tofu wrap (1 \u00d7 $11.25)**\n  - Refund of $11.25, or\n  - Credit of $13.50\n- **Lemonade (2 \u00d7 $4.00 = $8.00)**\n  - Refund of $8.00, or\n  - Credit of $9.60\n\nYou can choose a refund or credit for each item separately. Refunds go to your Visa ending in 4242. Credit goes to your Forkful account. Both options together would be $25 in credit at most, which is the most I can issue as account credit in one conversation. So if you choose credit for both, the total is $23.10.\n\nWhich option would you like for the wrap and for the lemonades?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks for covering the lemonades too. I'd prefer account credit since I order from Forkful almost every week. So credit for both would work for me."
